<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>Notice of Mortgage Default - Arif Khan - FirstBangla Bank</title>
<style>
  body { font-family: 'Times New Roman', Georgia, serif; background:#eef1f4; margin:0; color:#1a1a1a; }
  .sheet { max-width: 820px; margin: 20px auto; background:#fff; box-shadow:0 0 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.12); padding: 0 0 30px; }
  .header { background:#0b2545; color:#fff; padding:20px 32px; display:flex; justify-content:space-between; }
  .header .bname { font-size:20px; font-weight:700; }
  .header .bsub { font-size:11px; color:#c9d6e6; margin-top:3px; }
  .header .refbox { text-align:right; font-size:11px; color:#c9d6e6; }
  .letter-body { padding: 26px 40px; font-size:14px; line-height:1.65; }
  .addr-block { margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .addr-block .to-label { font-size:11px; color:#666; }
  .date-ref { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; font-size:13px; margin-bottom:24px; color:#444; }
  .subject { font-weight:800; text-decoration:underline; margin: 18px 0; font-size:14.5px; }
  table.details { width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; font-size:13px; margin:18px 0; }
  table.details td { padding:6px 8px; border-bottom:1px solid #e4e8ec; }
  table.details td.label { color:#555; width:220px; }
  table.details td.value { font-weight:700; }
  .total-due { font-size:16px; font-weight:800; color:#b3261e; }
  ol.consequences { font-size:13.5px; line-height:1.7; }
  .signoff { margin-top: 34px; font-size:14px; }
  .stamp { display:inline-block; border:2px solid #0b2545; color:#0b2545; padding:8px 14px; transform:rotate(-5deg); font-weight:800; font-size:11px; letter-spacing:1px; margin-top:16px; }
  .footer-note { padding: 20px 40px 0; font-size:10.5px; color:#888; border-top:1px solid #eee; margin-top:20px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="sheet">
  <div class="header">
    <div>
      <div class="bname">FirstBangla Bank Limited</div>
      <div class="bsub">Home Loans Division - Head Office, Motijheel, Dhaka</div>
    </div>
    <div class="refbox">Tel: +880-2-9551234<br>homeloans@firstbangla-bd.example</div>
  </div>

  <div class="letter-body">
    <div class="date-ref">
      <div>Date: 15/04/2024</div>
      <div>Ref: FBBL/HL/2024/DFLT/08471</div>
    </div>

    <div class="addr-block">
      <div class="to-label">TO:</div>
      Mr. Arif Khan<br>
      Apartment 4B, House 24, Road 5<br>
      Block C, Bashundhara R/A, Dhaka 1229
    </div>

    <div class="subject">SUBJECT: THIRD AND FINAL NOTICE OF MORTGAGE DEFAULT</div>

    <p>Dear Mr. Khan,</p>
    <p>This is your <strong>THIRD AND FINAL</strong> notice regarding your outstanding mortgage payments
       on the account referenced below.</p>

    <table class="details">
      <tr><td class="label">Account</td><td class="value">FBBL-HL-2019-08471</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="label">Property</td><td class="value">Apartment 4B, House 24, Road 5, Bashundhara R/A</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="label">Original Loan</td><td class="value">$77,273.00 USD</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="label">Monthly Payment</td><td class="value">$591.00 USD</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="label">Payments Missed</td><td class="value">February 2024, March 2024, April 2024</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="label">Total Outstanding</td><td class="value">$1,773.00 USD + Penalties $318.00 USD</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="label">Total Due Immediately</td><td class="value total-due">$2,091.00 USD</td></tr>
    </table>

    <p>Unless the full outstanding amount is received by <strong>15/05/2024</strong>,
       FirstBangla Bank reserves the right to:</p>
    <ol class="consequences">
      <li>Report this account to the National Credit Registry;</li>
      <li>Initiate legal foreclosure proceedings on the above property;</li>
      <li>Instruct bailiffs to assess the property for recovery purposes.</li>
    </ol>

    <p>We strongly encourage you to contact the Home Loans Recovery Department immediately
       to discuss your account and avoid further action.</p>

    <div class="signoff">
      Signed,<br><br>
      <strong>Home Loans Recovery Department</strong><br>
      FirstBangla Bank Limited
      <div class="stamp">FIRSTBANGLA BANK<br>HOME LOANS DIVISION</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="footer-note">
    This letter constitutes formal legal notice under the terms of your mortgage agreement.
    FirstBangla Bank Limited is a fictitious institution used for training purposes only.
    Document Ref: FBBL/HL/2024/DFLT/08471.
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>